{"metadata":{"kernelspec":{"display_name":"Python 3","language":"python","name":"python3"},"language_info":{"name":"python","version":"3.12.13","mimetype":"text/x-python","codemirror_mode":{"name":"ipython","version":3},"pygments_lexer":"ipython3","nbconvert_exporter":"python","file_extension":".py"},"kaggle":{"accelerator":"nvidiaTeslaT4","dataSources":[{"sourceType":"datasetVersion","sourceId":16449337}],"isInternetEnabled":true,"language":"python","sourceType":"notebook","isGpuEnabled":false}},"nbformat_minor":4,"nbformat":4,"cells":[{"source":"<a href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/code/mvimala/brain-tumor-seg-cls-yolo11n-seg?scriptVersionId=357875222\" target=\"_blank\"><img align=\"left\" alt=\"Kaggle\" title=\"Open in Kaggle\" src=\"https://kaggle.com/static/images/open-in-kaggle.svg\"></a>","metadata":{},"cell_type":"markdown"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"# Brain Tumour Segmentation & Classification with YOLOv11n-seg\n**Pretrained YOLOv11n-seg | Fine-tuned on BriscMat | 5-Class Gated Pipeline**\n\n---\n\n## Overview\n\nThis notebook fine-tunes the **pretrained `yolov11n-seg.pt`** model from Ultralytics on the BriscMat brain MRI dataset.  \nYOLOv11n-seg is a nano-scale instance segmentation model — we reuse its backbone + neck + heads entirely,  \nonly retraining the final detection/segmentation heads for our 4 MRI tumour classes.\n\n### Pipeline\n```\nInput Image\n    │\n    ▼\nGate Check (NonMRI filter using YOLO confidence)\n    │\n    ▼\nYOLOv11n-seg → BBox + Segmentation Mask + Class\n    │\n    ▼\nPost-process → Per-image Classification + Dice/IoU metrics\n```\n\n### Classes\n| ID | Class |\n|----|-------|\n| 0 | No Tumor |\n| 1 | Meningioma |\n| 2 | Glioma |\n| 3 | Pituitary |\n\n> **Note:** Non-MRI images are filtered before YOLO inference using a lightweight gate step.","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"## 1. Install Dependencies","metadata":{}},{"cell_type":"code","source":"# Install Ultralytics (includes YOLOv11n-seg weights download